# Project Overview

**Freediving & CO2 Tables** — an Expo/React Native iOS app for CO2 and O2 static-apnea tables. Sessions are stored on device.

## Key Dependencies

- **Expo 54** / React Native 0.81.5 / React 19 (new architecture enabled)
- **styled-components/native** for component styles
- **Drizzle ORM** + Expo SQLite for persistence
- **RevenueCat** (`react-native-purchases`) for the lifetime access purchase

Web is unsupported. iOS is the shipping target.
